- adv-tsuzukeru: The contrast places 続ける in an activity maintained by an actor, suggesting volitional action only. The cited primary source explicitly says the compound attaches to transitive and intransitive verbs alike and to volitional or non-volitional processes. 雨が降り続けています is valid as well as 雨が降り続いています; the difference cannot be reduced to an actor maintaining an action. Corrected payload SHA256: e958534ea2b3b97edf124120c152000722b08460e4b9d5bbb38aebdb5d3cca95. (13 October 2026)
